Ada , it 's the police !

551
01:03:13,583 --> 01:03:15,751
The police ? I 've done nothing wrong .

552
01:03:15,835 --> 01:03:17,545
Think about it .

553
01:03:19,339 --> 01:03:20,965
They want to get you .

554
01:03:21,048 --> 01:03:23,008
- Me ? - To trap you .

555
01:03:23,968 --> 01:03:25,428
I 'll call to check .

556
01:03:25,511 --> 01:03:29,014
Don 't bother . It 's Souleiman , I can feel it .

557
01:03:31,434 --> 01:03:32,477
Dior ...

558
01:03:46,366 --> 01:03:47,367
Hello .

559
01:03:48,200 --> 01:03:49,702
Who 's that ?

560
01:03:49,785 --> 01:03:53,706
You texted me last night . Who are you ?

561
01:03:54,790 --> 01:03:58,127
I helped out a guy who wanted to send a message .

562
01:03:58,210 --> 01:03:59,629
What did he look like ?

563
01:03:59,712 --> 01:04:02,340
A young guy . I don 't know , he looked blind .

564
01:04:02,423 --> 01:04:04,634
Blind ? Are you messing with me ?

565
01:04:06,636 --> 01:04:08,763
Stop being paranoid . I 'm going .

566
01:04:08,846 --> 01:04:11,349
- Ada , no ... - Give me your keys .

567
01:04:11,432 --> 01:04:13,100
It 's a trap .

568
01:04:13,183 --> 01:04:15,311
I 'm a big girl . Your keys !

569
01:04:15,728 --> 01:04:17,438
It 's a trap .

570
01:04:17,522 --> 01:04:19,231
Dior , I 'm a big girl .

571
01:04:19,315 --> 01:04:20,483
Your keys !

572
01:04:20,566 --> 01:04:22,693
Ada , you can 't be serious .

573
01:04:36,248 --> 01:04:38,418
What would I do without you ?

574
01:04:46,926 --> 01:04:48,052
Mrs. Niang .

575
01:04:48,636 --> 01:04:50,971
- What 's going on ? - Dior , leave us .

576
01:04:51,055 --> 01:04:52,598
Move along .

577
01:04:53,474 --> 01:04:54,809
Let me talk to her .

578
01:04:54,892 --> 01:04:56,811
Leave us .

579
01:04:56,894 --> 01:04:59,397
- I 'm not done with you . - Don 't you get it ?

580
01:04:59,480 --> 01:05:02,650
I don 't know where Souleiman is . You can 't follow me like this !

581
01:05:02,733 --> 01:05:04,109
You don 't know the law .

582
01:05:04,193 --> 01:05:07,154
Talk or you 'll make things worse for yourself .

583
01:05:07,237 --> 01:05:09,323
- What do you want ? - Tell me where Souleiman is .

584
01:05:09,407 --> 01:05:10,825
I 've already told you .

585
01:05:11,492 --> 01:05:13,077
Souleiman went to sea .

586
01:05:13,160 --> 01:05:15,788
No , he started the fire .

587
01:05:15,871 --> 01:05:18,458
Look at me . Talk or I 'll lock you up .

588
01:05:21,251 --> 01:05:22,587
You really want to know ?

589
01:05:23,838 --> 01:05:27,592
It 's true , Souleiman was more than a friend .

590
01:05:27,675 --> 01:05:29,093
That 's no revelation .

591
01:05:29,176 --> 01:05:30,428
Now leave me alone .

592
01:05:30,511 --> 01:05:32,388
Where are you going ? Let 's go .

593
01:05:32,472 --> 01:05:33,723
Leave me alone !

594
01:05:34,557 --> 01:05:36,809
- Let me out ! - Shut up !

595
01:05:36,892 --> 01:05:40,020
Let me out ! I haven 't done anything !

596
01:05:40,104 --> 01:05:41,397
Tell me what I 've done !

597
01:05:42,314 --> 01:05:43,983
Don 't make me come over there .

598
01:05:44,066 --> 01:05:45,275
I haven 't done anything .

599
01:05:45,860 --> 01:05:47,277
What have I done ?

600
01:05:51,198 --> 01:05:55,035
Yes , the boat comes from Kafountine ,

601
01:05:55,119 --> 01:05:56,245
in Casamance .

602
01:05:58,623 --> 01:05:59,457
Anyway ...

603
01:05:59,540 --> 01:06:02,209
The survivors said something that might interest you .

604
01:06:03,293 --> 01:06:06,255
You know there was a storm a few days ago .

605
01:06:11,343 --> 01:06:12,177
Hello ?

606
01:06:13,888 --> 01:06:17,600
They managed to stay afloat . They 're fishermen , they 're used to it .

607
01:06:17,683 --> 01:06:20,645
But the next day , they ran into an overturned boat .

608
01:06:21,521 --> 01:06:23,355
No sign of life anywhere near .

609
01:06:24,064 --> 01:06:26,859
The boat might have been drifting for a while .

610
01:06:27,485 --> 01:06:29,779
It was broken in half .

611
01:06:30,362 --> 01:06:32,740
The chances of finding survivors are bleak .

612
01:06:34,241 --> 01:06:35,451
Hello ?

613
01:06:38,245 --> 01:06:40,456
I 'll call you back if anything comes up .

614
01:06:43,459 --> 01:06:44,877
Bye , good luck .

615
01:06:49,256 --> 01:06:51,341
Did you lock up the girl who 's shouting ?

616
01:06:51,426 --> 01:06:53,010
Yes , I want her to talk .

617
01:06:53,093 --> 01:06:54,386
What 's wrong with you ?

618
01:06:56,180 --> 01:06:58,641
Her husband 's here . Let her go .

619
01:06:58,724 --> 01:07:00,350
Ask me first next time !

620
01:07:01,351 --> 01:07:03,771
I couldn 't reach you last night . Why ?

621
01:07:04,564 --> 01:07:05,940
I felt ill again .

622
01:07:06,023 --> 01:07:07,942
Have you seen a doctor ?

623
01:07:08,025 --> 01:07:10,027
Yes , it 's nothing serious .

624
01:07:10,110 --> 01:07:13,030
If it 's nothing , then be reachable 24 / 7 .

625
01:07:13,781 --> 01:07:14,740
Right .

626
01:07:14,824 --> 01:07:18,368
Some girls got into Mr. N 'Diaye 's place , asking for money .

627
01:07:18,994 --> 01:07:21,038
- Girls ? - About ten of them .

628
01:07:21,121 --> 01:07:24,416
Put a patrol there from 8 : 00 p.m. to 6 : 00 a.m. Got it ?

629
01:07:24,500 --> 01:07:26,586
I don 't want to hear any more about this .

630
01:07:28,170 --> 01:07:31,507
Were the girls there about the unpaid wages ?

631
01:07:31,591 --> 01:07:33,968
What unpaid wages ? That 's not our problem .

632
01:07:34,051 --> 01:07:36,679
They broke in , that 's all .

633
01:07:37,472 --> 01:07:39,348
Sort it out . I want it to stop .

634
01:07:39,974 --> 01:07:42,893
Mr. N 'Diaye has done a lot for us .

635
01:07:45,563 --> 01:07:47,106
Now let the girl go .

636
01:08:06,501 --> 01:08:08,460
My phone . And my bag .

637
01:08:13,465 --> 01:08:14,550
Is this it ?

638
01:08:34,111 --> 01:08:35,279
What is it ?

639
01:08:36,113 --> 01:08:37,823
What are you doing ?

640
01:08:38,991 --> 01:08:40,409
What 's wrong ?

641
01:08:42,369 --> 01:08:43,203
Nothing .

642
01:08:43,287 --> 01:08:45,330
Did they do something to you ?

643
01:08:45,414 --> 01:08:47,875
- No , nothing . - So come on , let 's go .

644
01:08:50,878 --> 01:08:52,337
What 's the problem ?

645
01:08:52,421 --> 01:08:53,756
I 'm not coming with you .

646
01:08:53,839 --> 01:08:56,592
Are you mad ? Did you bang your head ?

647
01:08:56,676 --> 01:08:58,803
Stop it , come on .

648
01:08:58,886 --> 01:09:00,304
Leave me alone , Omar .

649
01:09:00,387 --> 01:09:01,972
I 'm not coming with you .

650
01:09:03,098 --> 01:09:05,935
What 's going on ? What are you waiting for ?

651
01:09:06,018 --> 01:09:07,937
What is this bullshit ?

652
01:09:08,729 --> 01:09:11,774
What 's got into you ? Get in , I don 't have time for this .

653
01:09:11,857 --> 01:09:12,692
Let me go !

654
01:09:12,775 --> 01:09:14,944
Why are you shouting ?

655
01:09:15,027 --> 01:09:17,321
- I 'll shout if I want . - I 'm your husband .

656
01:09:17,404 --> 01:09:19,073
I 'm not your wife !

657
01:09:19,156 --> 01:09:20,157
What ?

658
01:09:20,950 --> 01:09:24,328
What ? We just got married and you 're not my wife ?

659
01:09:24,411 --> 01:09:25,830
I don 't love you .

660
01:09:25,913 --> 01:09:26,956
Let go of me !

661
01:09:27,039 --> 01:09:28,415
She 's gone mad !

662
01:09:28,498 --> 01:09:29,542
Where are you going ?

663
01:09:30,125 --> 01:09:31,335
Have you gone mad ?

664
01:09:33,796 --> 01:09:35,631
You know what ? Piss off !

665
01:09:35,715 --> 01:09:38,508
You wouldn 't give me a hard-on , anyway !

666
01:09:38,593 --> 01:09:39,719
She 's mad .

667
01:10:46,576 --> 01:10:48,412
I want to sell my phone .

668
01:10:51,081 --> 01:10:52,207
iPhone .

669
01:10:59,381 --> 01:11:00,925
Two hundred thousand .

670
01:11:01,008 --> 01:11:02,176
I 'll give you 150,000 .

671
01:11:02,259 --> 01:11:03,719
No , 200,000 .

672
01:11:04,594 --> 01:11:05,888
Is it yours ?

673
01:11:05,971 --> 01:11:08,098
Yes , it was a present .

674
01:11:09,809 --> 01:11:11,977
- I 'll give you 150,000 . - 200,000 .

675
01:11:13,478 --> 01:11:15,230
- Is that your last word ? - Yes .

676
01:11:19,109 --> 01:11:20,695
Do you want a replacement ?

677
01:11:21,320 --> 01:11:22,529
That one .

678
01:11:24,865 --> 01:11:27,534
Let 's discuss the price , then .

679
01:12:14,206 --> 01:12:15,708
As soon as she wakes up ,

680
01:12:15,791 --> 01:12:19,920
Mariama must plunge verses of the Quran

681
01:12:20,004 --> 01:12:21,630
into a bowl of clean water ,

682
01:12:21,714 --> 01:12:24,717
and then pour the holy water over her head .

683
01:12:24,800 --> 01:12:28,262
That will instantly drive away the spirits .

684
01:12:29,722 --> 01:12:33,017
Then , if your daughter behaves like a good Muslim ,

685
01:12:33,100 --> 01:12:38,022
says her prayers five times a day and wears the veil ,

686
01:12:38,105 --> 01:12:40,690
there 's no reason

687
01:12:40,775 --> 01:12:44,486
for the spirits to come back to torment her .

688
01:12:45,320 --> 01:12:47,740
God bless us all .

689
01:12:50,534 --> 01:12:51,660
Thank you .

690
01:13:02,797 --> 01:13:05,049
Thanks again . Have a pleasant evening .

691
01:13:14,391 --> 01:13:15,600
Mariama ?

692
01:13:36,872 --> 01:13:40,167
Watch carefully . You see this bit ?

693
01:13:41,210 --> 01:13:42,586
You put it here ,

694
01:13:42,669 --> 01:13:44,254
then turn it

695
01:13:45,005 --> 01:13:46,215
and pull .

696
01:13:48,467 --> 01:13:53,430
The other end is for opening soft drinks and beer .

697
01:13:55,640 --> 01:13:59,895
Vodka and liqueurs go in the small glasses .

698
01:14:01,146 --> 01:14:02,564
I hope you 're getting this .

699
01:14:02,647 --> 01:14:06,151
Soft-drink glass , wine glass , spirit glass .

700
01:14:07,152 --> 01:14:08,445
- Got it ? - Yes .

701
01:14:08,528 --> 01:14:10,489
You have to remember it all .

702
01:14:25,921 --> 01:14:30,300
How can you still believe it 's Souleiman ?

703
01:14:31,510 --> 01:14:32,761
You shouldn 't go .

704
01:15:25,940 --> 01:15:27,399
Where 's the money ?

705
01:15:42,581 --> 01:15:45,625
We 'll wait for you tomorrow at 3 : 00 a.m. in the cemetery .

706
01:15:48,253 --> 01:15:50,464
If you don 't have the money then ,

707
01:15:50,547 --> 01:15:52,382
we 'll burn your tower down .

708
01:17:06,790 --> 01:17:08,042
Where have you come from ?

709
01:17:09,418 --> 01:17:10,794
I 'm talking to you !

710
01:18:29,664 --> 01:18:30,957
Souleiman ?

711
01:18:33,168 --> 01:18:34,919
Souleiman , is that you ?

712
01:18:40,884 --> 01:18:42,093
Ada ...

713
01:18:45,764 --> 01:18:47,557
Souleiman , it 's the police ! Run !

714
01:18:53,104 --> 01:18:54,314
Ada .

715
01:19:00,320 --> 01:19:02,071
Ada ... it 's me .

716
01:19:08,495 --> 01:19:09,996
It 's me , Souleiman .

717
01:19:43,822 --> 01:19:44,906
Dior !

718
01:19:45,574 --> 01:19:47,075
- I saw ... - Ada .

719
01:19:49,202 --> 01:19:51,079
- Tell me ! - The boys are back .

720
01:19:51,162 --> 01:19:52,205
What ?

721
01:19:53,206 --> 01:19:54,541
Ada , wait !

722
01:20:09,931 --> 01:20:11,140
Fanta ?

723
01:20:26,990 --> 01:20:28,032
Ada .

724
01:20:30,327 --> 01:20:34,080
Souleiman told me about you in the boat .

725
01:20:37,751 --> 01:20:38,960
You know ...

726
01:20:41,796 --> 01:20:43,632
in your final moments ,

727
01:20:46,217 --> 01:20:48,261
you unburden your heart .

728
01:20:51,765 --> 01:20:52,974
He told me ...

729
01:20:55,727 --> 01:20:57,437
that he regretted so much

730
01:20:58,522 --> 01:21:00,732
not having said goodbye to you .

731
01:21:04,403 --> 01:21:05,987
He couldn 't .

732
01:21:08,239 --> 01:21:10,283
None of us could .

733
01:21:12,661 --> 01:21:13,662
Ada .

734
01:21:16,498 --> 01:21:17,666
Souleiman ...

735
01:21:18,583 --> 01:21:20,126
You were the love of his life .

736
01:21:25,214 --> 01:21:26,925
He wanted to come back for you .

737
01:21:29,386 --> 01:21:30,929
And be yours .

738
01:21:40,146 --> 01:21:41,981
It was about 5 : 00 a.m.

739
01:21:44,443 --> 01:21:46,110
It was quiet in the boat .

740
01:21:49,864 --> 01:21:51,324
As the sun was rising ,

741
01:21:52,200 --> 01:21:55,620
the guys were quiet .

742
01:21:58,998 --> 01:22:01,125
I thought we were nearly there

743
01:22:02,544 --> 01:22:06,465
because I could see a mountain in the distance .

744
01:22:09,718 --> 01:22:13,430
I thought we 'd reached Spain

745
01:22:15,640 --> 01:22:17,934
and we 'd finally be able to call you all .

746
01:22:22,396 --> 01:22:26,275
I shouted for joy .

747
01:22:27,777 --> 01:22:29,654
Then it all happened so quickly .

748
01:22:37,120 --> 01:22:42,959
A strong wind whipped up the sea .

749
01:22:46,045 --> 01:22:49,591
We were terrified

750
01:22:50,884 --> 01:22:52,636
by the power of the waves .

751
01:22:55,847 --> 01:22:59,142
Some were shivering with fear .

752
01:23:03,021 --> 01:23:08,568
Others were sobbing with distress .

753
01:23:11,029 --> 01:23:14,699
What I 'd thought was a mountain

754
01:23:15,449 --> 01:23:18,077
was a wave .

755
01:23:19,453 --> 01:23:20,914
Immense .

756
01:23:23,500 --> 01:23:28,421
It lifted up our boat , which collapsed like a building .

757
01:23:31,883 --> 01:23:34,052
We were cast into the depths .

758
01:24:12,048 --> 01:24:13,216
Chief !

759
01:24:15,301 --> 01:24:16,720
The girl has gone .

760
01:25:40,136 --> 01:25:46,184
MISSED CALLS COMMISSAIRE SY

761
01:26:07,121 --> 01:26:10,208
You know what happened last night ? Another fire .

762
01:26:10,959 --> 01:26:12,836
A fire is raging and you 're sleeping ?

763
01:26:13,669 --> 01:26:16,380
At Mr. N 'Diaye 's . Again , nothing sparked it .

764
01:26:16,464 --> 01:26:18,842
Commissaire , let me do the investigation .

765
01:26:19,383 --> 01:26:20,426
Please .

766
01:26:28,434 --> 01:26:29,268
Go ahead .

767
01:26:29,352 --> 01:26:30,269
Thank you .

768
01:32:26,250 --> 01:32:27,251
Twenty .

769
01:32:28,627 --> 01:32:30,213
Twenty-two .

770
01:32:31,505 --> 01:32:32,631
Twenty-four .

771
01:32:38,011 --> 01:32:39,722
Twenty-six .

772
01:32:40,889 --> 01:32:42,725
Twenty-eight .

773
01:32:43,726 --> 01:32:44,560
Thirty .

774
01:32:44,643 --> 01:32:46,979
Let me go . You have the money .

775
01:32:47,062 --> 01:32:48,481
You 're going nowhere .

776
01:32:48,564 --> 01:32:50,816
It 's your fault we 're dead . Never forget .

777
01:32:50,899 --> 01:32:52,067
I 'm sorry .

778
01:32:52,151 --> 01:32:53,277
" I 'm sorry . "

779
01:32:55,613 --> 01:32:57,114
You have your money .

780
01:32:57,198 --> 01:32:58,616
Thirty-two million .

781
01:32:58,699 --> 01:32:59,825
It 's all there .

782
01:33:00,368 --> 01:33:01,619
Let me go .

783
01:33:01,702 --> 01:33:02,703
Not yet .

784
01:33:06,707 --> 01:33:08,459
Dig our graves first .

785
01:33:26,310 --> 01:33:28,312
Look , he doesn 't even know how to dig .

786
01:33:34,443 --> 01:33:35,819
That 's real work !

787
01:33:36,654 --> 01:33:37,905
Dig till your hands burn .

788
01:33:55,673 --> 01:33:57,174
Faster !

789
01:33:58,884 --> 01:34:00,469
Every time ...

790
01:34:02,555 --> 01:34:05,766
you look at the top of the tower ,

791
01:34:06,975 --> 01:34:11,021
you 'll think of our unburied bodies

792
01:34:11,689 --> 01:34:13,441
at the bottom of the ocean .

793
01:37:16,373 --> 01:37:18,751
I knew you 'd be back .

794
01:37:22,880 --> 01:37:25,048
It could only be you .

795
01:37:27,718 --> 01:37:29,637
I 'll always taste

796
01:37:30,971 --> 01:37:34,307
the salt of your body in the sweat of mine .

797
01:37:37,394 --> 01:37:38,854
How beautiful you are .

798
01:37:40,939 --> 01:37:45,110
I saw you in the enormous wave which consumed us .

799
01:37:47,070 --> 01:37:50,533
All I saw was your eyes and your tears .

800
01:37:52,409 --> 01:37:56,830
I felt your weeping dragging me to the shore .

801
01:38:00,375 --> 01:38:04,046
Your eyes never left me .

802
01:38:05,213 --> 01:38:07,132
They were there , within me .

803
01:38:09,051 --> 01:38:12,220
Pouring their light into the depths .

804
01:39:06,274 --> 01:39:07,359
Fanta ?

805
01:39:28,922 --> 01:39:29,923
Commissaire .

806
01:39:38,056 --> 01:39:39,474
The case is closed .

807
01:40:32,736 --> 01:40:34,071
Come on , girl !

808
01:40:53,131 --> 01:40:56,093
Some memories are omens .

809
01:40:58,595 --> 01:41:00,638
Last night will stay with me ,

810
01:41:00,723 --> 01:41:02,557
to remind me who I am ...

811
01:41:05,477 --> 01:41:07,604
and show me who I will become .

812
01:41:10,232 --> 01:41:11,900
Ada , to whom the future belongs .

813
01:41:15,362 --> 01:41:16,863
I am Ada .

814
01:45:41,287 --> 01:45:43,289
Subtitle translation by Howard Bonsor

